# Nameless Inversion's -3 toughness leaves Bot2's Ornithopter, a 0/2, at 3/-1: a creature with toughness 0 or less is put
# into its owner's graveyard (CR 704.5f), and it is not destroyed, so nothing could regenerate it. Bot1 casts the
# Inversion at instant speed on Bot2's turn 2, after the Ornithopter is cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Nameless Inversion
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Nameless Inversion.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
